    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n234 Eagle Valley is a well-presented four/five-bedroom end-of-terrace property situated within a private cul-de-sac setting. \n\nPresented in good condition throughout, this is a fantastic opportunity to buy a home or investment in such a convenient and mature residential area of Cork.\n\nAccommodation, in brief, extends to an entrance hall, living room, shower room, kitchen and dining room / 5th bedroom all at ground floor level. The first-floor hosts four bedrooms with the main bedroom having an en-suite and a family bathroom. \n\nThis property enjoys a private driveway to the front with off-street parking.\n\nThe rear garden is both enclosed and well-maintained.\n\nEagle Valley is a popular development just off Sarsfield Road. The property is convenient to the South Ring Road Network and close to all amenities including the CUH, Wilton shopping, centre, schools, shops etc. Eagle Valley is particularly attractive to the medical profession with its proximity to all major hospitals. \n\nThis fantastic opportunity for homeowners or investors that should not be missed.\n\nDon't delay, arrange a viewing today."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.94m x 5.59m\nA welcoming entrance hall with under-stairs storage and a laminate wood floor.\n\nLiving Room - 3.59m x 5.60m\nBright, inviting reception room to the front of the property that features an open fireplace.\n\nShower Room - 0.84m x 2.53m\nPartially tiled shower room with a three-piece suite and walk-in shower unit.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - 2.68m x 5.89m\nFully fitted kitchen with eye and floor-level units with all appliances. Tiled over-counter splashback. Access to the rear garden can be gained from here.\n\nDining/Bedroom 5 - 2.84m x 3.73m\nAccessed off the kitchen, this room makes an ideal dining room or a 5th bedroom. There is a sliding glass door that gives access to the rear garden.\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 2.40m 4.21m\nThe landing opens to all bedrooms and family bathroom. Hot press storage.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.97m x 4.10m\nDouble bedroom positioned to the front of the property, with built-in wardrobes and overhead cupboards.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.33m x 0.83m\nEn suite with three-piece suite with walk-in shower unit.\n\nBeroom 2 - 3.25m x 3.48m\nSpacious double bedroom which overlooks the rear with built-in wardrobes and overhead cupboards.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.41m x 2.92m\nSingle bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.67m x 2.45m\nSingle bedroom which overlooks the front of the property with built-in wardrobes.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 3.59m x 2.05m\nPartially tiled family bathroom with three-piece suite. Bathtub and shower fitting.\n\nProperty Features - \n• Mature residential location• Close proximity to Cork city• Ideal family home/ Investment opportunity• Good condition throughout\n\n"
      },
